# requirements.txt is the hash-pinned lock compiled from this file (direct + transitive) with
# pip-tools (BSD-3-Clause) under Python 3.12; api/Dockerfile and CI install it with
# --require-hashes. After a change here (Dependabot updates both files):
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe --strip-extras --no-emit-index-url \
#     --output-file requirements.txt requirements.in
